    {
      "id": "math1110-found-trig-identity",
      "front": "Complete the identity: \\(\\sin^2x+\\cos^2x=\\ ?\\)",
      "back": "\\(1\\). Note: \\(\\sin^2x\\) means \\((\\sin x)^2\\).",
